## Обработка ошибок

### Try-Catch только для внешних систем
```csharp
public async Task PublishAsync(SendMessageCommand command, CancellationToken ct)
{
    try
    {
        var payload = command.ToByteArray();
        await _connection.PublishAsync(Subject, payload);

        _logger.LogInformation("Command published",
            new { command.ChatId, Subject });
    }
    catch (Exception ex)
    {
        _logger.LogError(ex, "Failed to publish command",
            new { command.ChatId, Subject });
        throw;
    }
}
```

### Не глотай исключения
**Плохо:**
```csharp
catch (Exception)
{
    return;
}
```

**Хорошо:**
```csharp
catch (NatsException ex)
{
    _logger.LogError(ex, "NATS connection failed");
    throw;
}
```

## NATS Integration

### IHostedService для подписки
```csharp
public class NatsEventListener : BackgroundService
{
    protected override async Task ExecuteAsync(CancellationToken stoppingToken)
    {
        using var connection = _connectionFactory.CreateConnection();
        using var subscription = connection.SubscribeAsync(Subject);

        await foreach (var msg in subscription.Messages.WithCancellation(stoppingToken))
        {
            await ProcessMessageAsync(msg, stoppingToken);
        }
    }

    private async Task ProcessMessageAsync(Msg msg, CancellationToken ct)
    {
        try
        {
            var evt = BidPlacedEvent.Parser.ParseFrom(msg.Data);
            await _handler.HandleAsync(evt, ct);
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            _logger.LogError(ex, "Failed to process message");
        }
    }
}
```

### Publisher как Singleton
```csharp
public interface INatsPublisher
{
    Task PublishSendMessageAsync(long chatId, string text, CancellationToken ct = default);
}

public class NatsPublisher : INatsPublisher, IDisposable
{
    private readonly IConnection _connection;
    private readonly string _subject;

    public NatsPublisher(IConfiguration config)
    {
        var factory = new ConnectionFactory();
        _connection = factory.CreateConnection(config["Nats:Url"]);
        _subject = config["Nats:Subjects:SendMessage"]!;
    }

    public async Task PublishSendMessageAsync(long chatId, string text, CancellationToken ct)
    {
        var command = new SendMessageCommand
        {
            ChatId = chatId,
            Text = text,
            ParseMode = ""
        };

        await _connection.PublishAsync(_subject, command.ToByteArray());
    }

    public void Dispose() => _connection?.Dispose();
}
```

